# oneDNN's model shapes on the matmul paths matmul.nightly leaves out: the
# bf16 GEMM path (jit:rvv), with the shapes of the perf-CI nightly (ResNet-50
# and BERT inner products as matmuls), bias on and off.

--reset
--dt=bf16:bf16:bf16
--bia-dt=undef
--bia_mask=2
--batch=shapes_converted_ip_inf_lb_resnet
--bia_mask=4
--batch=shapes_bert
